## Interface: 11200
## Title: |cff175581Octo|r|cffC4C4C4UI|r
## Notes: Complete User Interface replacement for OctoWoW. Based on the ElvUI 1.12.1 backport.
## Author: Carcer - N'Zoth. Based on ElvUI by Elv and Simpy, 1.12.1 backport by the ElvUI-Vanilla contributors.
## Version: 1.0.0
## SavedVariables: ElvDB, ElvPrivateDB, GAME_LOCALE
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: ElvCharacterDB, OctoTWT_CONFIG, TWT_CONFIG
## OptionalDeps: SharedMedia, Tukui, ButtonFacade

# Compatibility polyfills. MUST stay first: everything below assumes select,
# string.match, string.gmatch, strsplit, hooksecurefunc and friends exist.
Compatibility\errorHandler.lua
Compatibility\api\api.xml
Compatibility\slashCommands.lua

# Engine
Developer\Load_Developer.xml
Libraries\Load_Libraries.xml
Locales\Load_Locales.xml
Media\Load_Media.xml
Init.lua
Settings\Load_Config.xml
Core\Load_Core.xml
Layout\Load_Layout.xml
Modules\Load_Modules.xml

# Options GUI. Was the separate load-on-demand ElvUI_Config addon; merged in so
# the whole UI installs from one git URL. Must stay last, its files resolve
# modules with E:GetModule at load time.
Config\Libraries\Load_Libraries.xml
Config\Locales\Load_Locales.xml
Config\Core.lua
Config\General.lua
Config\ActionBars.lua
Config\Auras.lua
Config\Bags.lua
Config\Chat.lua
Config\DataTexts.lua
Config\NamePlates.lua
Config\Skins.lua
Config\Tooltip.lua
Config\UnitFrames.lua
Config\DataBars.lua
Config\Maps.lua
Config\ModuleControl.lua
